name: Dino Island
slug: 2024-04-dinoisland
date: 27 April 2024
venue: Quaker Meeting House, Reading, RG1 2SB
location: READING
tagline: Big business and even bigger lizards!
description: |
  Dino Island is a unique and thrilling theme park that takes visitors on a journey to the time of the dinosaurs. Unlike traditional parks, the dinosaurs at Dino Island have been brought to life through advanced genetic manipulation, making them as real as they were millions of years ago.
  
  With over 30 species of dinosaurs, visitors can witness these magnificent creatures roam, hunt, and interact with one another in their natural habitats. The park's attractions include the Dino Safari, where guests can explore the park on a guided tour and observe the dinosaurs in their habitats, and the T-Rex Pursuit, an adrenaline-fueled ride where visitors will come face-to-face with a massive T-Rex.
  
  In addition to the thrilling experiences, Dino Island is also dedicated to advancing the science of genetic engineering and dinosaur research. The park's research centre, staffed by top geneticists and palaeontologists, is at the forefront of this field.
  
  Visitors can learn about the science behind Dino Island, including the methods used to bring the dinosaurs to life, and even participate in interactive exhibits and educational programs.
