name: Secrets of Arkham
slug: 2024-02-arkham
date: 10 February 2024
venue: Quaker Meeting House, Reading, RG1 2SB
location: READING
tagline: As the storm clouds close in, can you uncover the secrets of Arkham?
description: |
  Reading Megagames is excited to present the third run of Secrets of Arkham, a megagame by Kristian Mitchell-Dolby. Players will join teams of 2-5, leading one of several factions vying for power and influence in the isolated and parochial city of Arkham, working to survive the growing tension and mounting threat of recent mysterious happenings. They'll discover enemies, form alliances, make questionable choices, and become increasingly embroiled in the horrors terrorising the city. Players will have to choose what side of the crisis they want to fall on before things get out of control, all whilst staying on top of their team's agenda and individual goals.
