name: Relics of the Fall 3
slug: 2022-09-relics3
date: 17 September 2022
venue: St Luke's Parish Hall, Reading, RG1 5LR
location: READING
tagline: Warrior mechs clash with imperial legions in a post-apocalyptic wasteland.
description: |
  Relics of the Fall is a game of post apocalyptic societies with Mad Max undertones. In the icy north lies the Steel Empire with its cruel Imperial Officials, whilst in the south lie the Silk City States led by rich merchant nobles. Between them wander the Wilder tribes - mysterious nomads who operate ancient and giant war mechs from before the Fall.
  
  Designed by Reading Megagames' own John Keyworth, Relics of the Fall has been run in Reading and Cambridge, UK.
