name: By Other Means
slug: 2021-10-byothermeans
date: 23 October 2021
venue: St Luke's Parish Hall, Reading, RG1 5LR
location: READING
tagline: Negotiating for peace in a galaxy at war.
description: |
  The war has lasted for decades, and devastated the galaxy. Now, the leaders of the warring nations have gathered to negotiate. Can they finally bring an end to the bloodshed? Or will the talks break down - and with them, what remains of galactic civilisation?
  
  Design and Game Control by Ed Silverstone.
