name: Urban Nightmare: London Calling
slug: 2020-01-urbannightmare
date: 25 January 2020
venue: St Luke's Parish Hall, Reading, RG1 5LR
location: READING
tagline: Zombies in the capital!
description: |
  When a strange new disease has citizens behaving erratically and aggressively, can the UK government and emergency services work together to prevent a zombie outbreak? Our run of this game saw breakdowns in communication, political corruption, and a certain amount of medical malpractice - but also an ultimately successful containment and control exercise.
  
  Design and Game Control by Jim Wallman.
