name: The Shot Heard Around the Universe
slug: 2019-11-shot
date: 2 November 2019
venue: St Luke's Parish Hall, Reading, RG1 5LR
location: READING
tagline: Resist imperial rule in space.
description: |
  The Shot Heard Around the Universe (or just 'Shot') is a space opera megagame of trade, politics, and revolution. In the Beyond Sector, a distant arm of the Terran Space Empire, rebels cause unrest whilst Imperial officials seek to maintain control and advance their own agendas. Between them are local planetary governments trying to flourish, and profit, amidst the conflict.
  
  The Shot Heard Around the Universe has been run in Leeds and Reading, UK.
  
  When Shot was run in Reading we saw aliens, rampant cloning, Rorschach tests, revolutions, more than a little backstabbing, and someone's hyperdrive was full of eels.
  
  Design by Tim Campbell; Game Control by Ed Silverstone.
