tagline: Aliens visit earth in this geopolitical simulator.
description: |
  Arrival, designed by Darren Green of Crisis Games, draws from the megagaming classic Watch the Skies, working in new communication mechanics, corporation rules, alien motivations, and ways of waging war. Arrival has been run in Cambridge and Reading, UK.
  
  Design and Game Control by Darren Green.
